<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  {%- comment -%}
    Title format for templated pages: "<Page Title> — J. Michael Constans".
    The homepage uses index.html (verbatim, bypasses this include) and sets
    its own title "J. Michael Constans — Principal Engineer" — that's the
    front-door tagline. Subpages prefix with their own title instead.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <title>{% if page.title %}{{ page.title }} — {% endif %}J. Michael Constans</title>
  <meta name="description" content="{{ page.description | default: site.description }}">
  <meta name="author" content="J. Michael Constans">
  <meta property="og:title" content="{% if page.title %}{{ page.title }} — {% endif %}J. Michael Constans">
  <meta property="og:description" content="{{ page.description | default: site.description }}">
  <meta property="og:url" content="{{ site.base_url }}/{{ page.permalink }}">
  <meta property="og:type" content="{% if page.collection == 'posts' %}article{% else %}website{% endif %}">
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/site.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/whitepaper.css">
  {%- comment -%}
    Whitepaper layout adds an extra stylesheet. Conditional so non-whitepaper
    pages don't pay the request. Keyed off page.data.kind (not page.layout)
    because the data is the canonical declaration of "what kind of writing
    this is" — layout is the rendering choice that follows from it.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    KaTeX for posts that opt in with `data: {math: true}`. Cobalt's markdown
    has no math support, so $...$ / $$...$$ are rendered client-side. Inside
    math, escape `_` as `\_` so markdown doesn't turn pairs into <em>.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if page.data.math %}
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.11/dist/katex.min.css" integrity="sha384-nB0miv6/jRmo5UMMR1wu3Gz6NLsoTkbqJghGIsx//Rlm+ZU03BU6SQNC66uf4l5+" crossorigin="anonymous">
  <script defer src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.11/dist/katex.min.js" integrity="sha384-7zkQWkzuo3B5mTepMUcHkMB5jZaolc2xDwL6VFqjFALcbeS9Ggm/Yr2r3Dy4lfFg" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
  <script defer src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.11/dist/contrib/auto-render.min.js" integrity="sha384-43gviWU0YVjaDtb/GhzOouOXtZMP/7XUzwPTstBeZFe/+rCMvRwr4yROQP43s0Xk" crossorigin="anonymous"
    onload="renderMathInElement(document.querySelector('.post-body') || document.body, {delimiters: [{left: '$$', right: '$$', display: true}, {left: '$', right: '$', display: false}, {left: '\\[', right: '\\]', display: true}, {left: '\\(', right: '\\)', display: false}], throwOnError: false});"></script>
  {%- endif %}
</head>
